  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0c5cbb483bddf4c478998c8960188805, type: 3}
  m_Name: L4_TheShadowTalk
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Lines:
  - You remember this smell, don't you? Chemicals and old paper. The red light...
    it's the only thing that keeps her from fading.
  - "Grandma always said that film is fragile. Once the harsh, white light touches
    it, the image is gone forever. That\u2019s what they want to do to us, Minh.
    The doctors, your parents... even Nam. They want to 'fix' you by bleaching your
    mind until she\u2019s nothing but a blank, white page."
  - "Look around you. This maze is everything you\u2019ve ever captured. It\u2019s
    messy and cold, but it\u2019s the only place where she still exists."
  - "But he\u2019s here now. The Overexposed. He is the glare of their judgment.
    He wants to burn this attic to the ground so you have nowhere left to hide."
  - "Don't let him see you. Find the fragments of her before the white light erases
    them. If these photos burn... then she\u2019s truly gone. And so are we."
  - Good luck, my naive self.
